[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あははっ、レスナちゃん強かったぁー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahahaha, you were so strong, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほのかちゃんのほうこそ！\u3000どの技も強烈で……\nでも、楽しかった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were incredible too! Every move packed a punch... But it was so much fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000視聴者のみんなも大盛り上がりだったね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! The viewers were super hyped too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、次の企画は～……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, what's our next project...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、これが道を走るんすねえ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, so this thing runs on the road..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "馬車より速いのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it faster than a carriage?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、これを洗えばいいんだっけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we just wash this, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。オーナーさんが、マリーはお掃除が得意だから、\n視聴者を盛り上げるのにピッタリだって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep. The owner said Marie's good at cleaning, so it'd be perfect for getting the viewers excited..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マリーにはよく分からなかったけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie didn't really get it though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははーん、なるほどね。\nアルビちゃん分かっちゃったかも、企画の狙い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aha, I see now. I think I get what they're going for with this project."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ、撮影は頼んだ！\u3000この中からお願いね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp, you're on filming duty! From inside here, please!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "任せて。姉様の魅力をばっちり伝えてみせるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me. I'll capture all of your charm perfectly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ、始めちゃいますよ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, let's get started!"
